                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Insert the Predictive Thermometer to at least the min line (shown above). </p><p>Press m- and s+ buttons to set the “cooking to” temperature.</p><p>Press “start” – the \"cooking to\" temp will stop blinking. </p><p>Apply heat (oven, smoker, grill, frying pan, etc… you get the idea).</p><p>The Display shows progress by indicating % of cooking completed.</p><p>At about 33% a countdown will appear: “ready in.” That’s the prediction! </p><p>When that number hits 00:00, an alarm will sound to let you know your food is ready.</p><p>Enjoy!</p>",
