                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>View (and graph) temps from all 8 sensors using <strong>Advanced Mode.</strong></p><ul><li>You'll find advanced mode in the settings menu.</li><li>You can toggle each sensor's display on/off by tapping the color-coded circle beneath each sensor.</li><li>Sensors are labeled from T1 (closest to the tip) to Ambient/T8 (the handle sensor).</li></ul>",
                    "width": "100%",
