              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_BpwePX": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We have a pretty sweet encyclopedia of knowledge in the <a href=\"/pages/faq\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FAQ\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Help Center/FAQ. </span></a></p><p><strong>Searchable by topic! </strong></p><p>You'll find all the various reference guides  as well as deeper answers to a wider variety of questions.</p><p>For instance: </p><p><a href=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fwifi-not-working-the-general-troubleshooting-guide-1009847\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fwifi-not-working-the-general-troubleshooting-guide-1009847\">WiFi troubleshooting?</a></p><p><a href=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fdisplay-controls-695637\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fdisplay-controls-695637\">What do the buttons on the Display do?</a></p><p><a href=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fusing-your-cpt-for-prime-rib-or-turkey-yes-you-can-845197\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq?hcUrl=%2Fen-US%2Fusing-your-cpt-for-prime-rib-or-turkey-yes-you-can-845197\">How exactly should I insert the thermometer into my roast?</a></p><p>And many more. </p><p>If you don't find what you're looking for, <a href=\"mailto:support@combustion.inc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@combustion.inc\">support@combustion.inc</a> is here to help. </p><p></p><p></p>",
